{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016KQaCug4xGqP8iJngyrM3D","type":"tool_result","content":"1288:def test_a_fresh_episode_executes_the_bootstrap_spine_once_through_langgraph(\n1289-    tmp_path: Path, monkeypatch\n1290-) -> None:\n1291-    \"\"\"Prompt TEST 1: the fresh path really runs, and D01 runs exactly once.\n1292-\n1293-    `selected_unit_id` is asserted off `D05_SELECT_NEXT_UNIT`'s own first\n1294-    update, not the run's final merged state: once N31 wires D16-D23 this\n1295-    clean single-unit episode legitimately loops back to a second `D05`\n1296-    call, whose `manifest_exhausted` guard correctly overwrites the\n1297-    `replace_current`-reduced `selected_unit_id` to `None` in final state —\n1298-    a real second call, not a repeat of the first one, so it is asserted for\n1299-    rather than assumed away (P-N30-001, closing N90 finding F1).\n1300-\n1301-    With D16-D23 now wired (P-N31-001), this clean one-unit episode really\n1302-    reaches acceptance: the second `D05_SELECT_NEXT_UNIT` call finds the\n1303-    manifest exhausted and routes to the still-deferred `D24_PROVE_EXACT_\n1304-    MANIFEST_COVERAGE`, whose `KeyError` is raised in the same tick as that\n1305-    second `D05` call's own routing decision -- a real, reproducible LangGraph\n1306-    `stream(stream_mode=\"updates\")` artifact: the chunk for a step whose\n1307-    *next* step's routing raises in the same tick is never yielded, so\n1308-    `result[\"trace\"]`'s own `D05_SELECT_NEXT_UNIT` count undercounts by\n1309-    exactly one in this exhausted-after-one-unit case (P-N31-003, closing the\n1310-    residual N90 finding F1 diagnosis). The real, checkpointed final state is\n1311-    unaffected by that streaming artifact, so it is asserted directly instead\n1312-    of inferring the outcome from a trace count this specific interaction\n1313-    cannot reliably produce.\n1314-    \"\"\"\n1315-\n1316-    fixture = _build_episode_fixture(tmp